[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 IDD (Interface Design Description)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDD-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Interface Design
STATEMENT: The system shall provide RESTful API interfaces for external system integration.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDD-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: User Interface
STATEMENT: The system shall provide web-based user interfaces with responsive design and accessibility features.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDD-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Data Interfaces
STATEMENT: The system shall support multiple data formats including JSON, XML, and CSV for data exchange.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDD-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Security Interfaces
STATEMENT: The system shall implement secure authentication and authorization interfaces.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.